; Shipped certificate library (ADR-0013), stdlib-only. The checker independently replays
; W1b equality elimination; it uses the existing CNF encoder only to bind the recorded
; post-Preprocess term to the raw Sat Query clauses. CNF and the lower Preprocess rewrite
; remain explicit trusted boundaries for this tranche.

